{
  "_comment": [
    "Cross-client case table for expense split and balance arithmetic (T-153, T-155).",
    "",
    "ONE file, read by BOTH test suites: web/src/lib/expenses.test.ts imports it, and the Android",
    "ExpenseMathTest reads it from the repo root the way TranslationResourcesTest reads res/.",
    "Two copies would drift, which is exactly how the i18n fixture went wrong (T-148).",
    "",
    "Amounts are decimal strings in the wire format, so each client's own parser is exercised too.",
    "The whole part is capped at 13 digits (T-262): unbounded, a 20-digit price/expense amount —",
    "legal under the server's old 32-CHARACTER cap — made Android's `whole.toLong()` throw and",
    "crash every member's list screen on every render. 13 digits is the largest width for which",
    "the cents value can never exceed JS's Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER, so to_cents_invalid's",
    "too-long cases must be refused by ALL of toCents/ExpenseMath.toCents/the server's",
    "PRICE_AMOUNT_RE, returning no value rather than throwing.",
    "Rounding rule: auto participants get the floor of an equal share, and the leftover cents go",
    "one each to the first auto participants in the given order. A participant whose share comes",
    "out at zero is absent from the result, never present with a zero amount.",
    "",
    "balances: largest credit first, then by account id compared as plain strings, NEVER with a",
    "locale-aware comparison — ids are opaque and the order must not depend on who is looking.",
    "The mixed-case case below is the one that tells the two rules apart.",
    "",
    "settle (T-163): input is each participant's signed balance, output the ordered transfers",
    "that zero them. Greedy: the largest debtor pays the largest creditor the smaller amount,",
    "whoever reaches zero drops out, repeat; ties in amount go by account id. Not always the",
    "fewest transfers, and both clients must produce exactly this order.",
    "",
    "ENTRY TYPES (T-245). Every entry in the balances/spent/effect groups carries an optional",
    "'type': 'expense', 'income' or 'transfer'. ABSENT MEANS 'expense' — that is every entry",
    "written before the type existed, and several cases leave it out on purpose to pin that",
    "default. All amounts stay positive whichever type it is; the sign lives in the type:",
    "  expense  someone paid for the group     paid += paid_by[a], share += paid_for[a]",
    "  income   the group received money       paid -= paid_by[a], share -= paid_for[a]",
    "  transfer one member pays another        settled += paid_by[a], settled -= paid_for[a]",
    "and balance = paid - share + settled, for every participant, always summing to zero over the",
    "whole ledger. Transfers stay OUT of paid/share so those two keep meaning 'what this person",
    "laid out / consumed' and settling a debt never looks like more spending; 'settled' carries",
    "them so the three figures still add up to the balance. paid, share and settled may each be",
    "negative, and the balances group's 'total' is the GROSS sum of every entry's amount, all",
    "three types included — it is not net spent, which is the 'spent' group below.",
    "",
    "spent (T-245): a ledger's entries -> what it spent. expenses = the total of every expense",
    "entry, income = the total of every income entry, net = expenses - income (may be negative).",
    "Transfers count for nothing. This is the 'Net spent' figure on every screen.",
    "",
    "effect (T-245): ONE entry and ONE account -> what that entry alone does to that account's",
    "balance, signed. expense and transfer give paid_by[a] - paid_for[a]; income negates it.",
    "'0.00' where the account is not on the entry, or the two sides cancel out."
  ],

  "to_cents": [
    { "amount": "0.01", "cents": 1 },
    { "amount": "12", "cents": 1200 },
    { "amount": "12.5", "cents": 1250 },
    { "amount": "12.50", "cents": 1250 },
    { "amount": "1234567.89", "cents": 123456789 },
    { "amount": "9999999999999.99", "cents": 999999999999999 }
  ],

  "to_cents_invalid": [
    "",
    "1.234",
    "1,50",
    "-1",
    "abc",
    "٥",
    "12345678901234",
    "12345678901234567890"
  ],

  "from_cents": [
    { "cents": 1, "amount": "0.01" },
    { "cents": 1200, "amount": "12.00" },
    { "cents": 1250, "amount": "12.50" },
    { "cents": 123456789, "amount": "1234567.89" }
  ],

  "equal_split": [
    {
      "name": "divides evenly",
      "total": "60.00",
      "participants": ["a", "b", "c"],
      "expect": { "a": "20.00", "b": "20.00", "c": "20.00" }
    },
    {
      "name": "one leftover cent goes to the first participant",
      "total": "64.00",
      "participants": ["a", "b", "c"],
      "expect": { "a": "21.34", "b": "21.33", "c": "21.33" }
    },
    {
      "name": "two leftover cents go to the first two, one each",
      "total": "10.00",
      "participants": ["a", "b", "c"],
      "expect": { "a": "3.34", "b": "3.33", "c": "3.33" }
    },
    {
      "name": "order decides who absorbs the leftovers",
      "total": "10.00",
      "participants": ["c", "b", "a"],
      "expect": { "c": "3.34", "b": "3.33", "a": "3.33" }
    },
    {
      "name": "a solo list gets the whole total",
      "total": "84.20",
      "participants": ["a"],
      "expect": { "a": "84.20" }
    },
    {
      "name": "shares too small to exist are absent, never zero",
      "total": "0.01",
      "participants": ["a", "b", "c"],
      "expect": { "a": "0.01" }
    }
  ],

  "distribute": [
    {
      "name": "all auto is an equal split",
      "total": "64.00",
      "entries": [{ "id": "a" }, { "id": "b" }, { "id": "c" }],
      "expect": { "a": "21.34", "b": "21.33", "c": "21.33" }
    },
    {
      "name": "one fixed share, the rest absorb the difference",
      "total": "60.00",
      "entries": [{ "id": "a", "fixed": "30.00" }, { "id": "b" }, { "id": "c" }],
      "expect": { "a": "30.00", "b": "15.00", "c": "15.00" }
    },
    {
      "name": "raising the total leaves the fixed share alone",
      "total": "64.00",
      "entries": [{ "id": "a", "fixed": "30.00" }, { "id": "b" }, { "id": "c" }],
      "expect": { "a": "30.00", "b": "17.00", "c": "17.00" }
    },
    {
      "name": "every entry fixed and summing to the total",
      "total": "64.00",
      "entries": [
        { "id": "a", "fixed": "21.34" },
        { "id": "b", "fixed": "21.33" },
        { "id": "c", "fixed": "21.33" }
      ],
      "expect": { "a": "21.34", "b": "21.33", "c": "21.33" }
    },
    {
      "name": "the payer covering everything leaves the others out entirely",
      "total": "40.00",
      "entries": [{ "id": "a", "fixed": "40.00" }, { "id": "b" }],
      "expect": { "a": "40.00" }
    },
    {
      "name": "a single auto entry takes the remainder whole",
      "total": "40.00",
      "entries": [{ "id": "a", "fixed": "9.99" }, { "id": "b" }],
      "expect": { "a": "9.99", "b": "30.01" }
    },
    {
      "name": "two payers, both fixed",
      "total": "64.00",
      "entries": [{ "id": "a", "fixed": "40.00" }, { "id": "b", "fixed": "24.00" }],
      "expect": { "a": "40.00", "b": "24.00" }
    },
    {
      "name": "fixed shares above the total",
      "total": "50.00",
      "entries": [{ "id": "a", "fixed": "30.00" }, { "id": "b", "fixed": "30.00" }],
      "error": "fixed_exceeds_total"
    },
    {
      "name": "every entry fixed, and they do not add up",
      "total": "64.00",
      "entries": [{ "id": "a", "fixed": "20.00" }, { "id": "b", "fixed": "20.00" }],
      "error": "fixed_sum_mismatch"
    },
    {
      "name": "a total of nothing",
      "total": "0",
      "entries": [{ "id": "a" }],
      "error": "total_not_positive"
    },
    {
      "name": "nobody selected",
      "total": "10.00",
      "entries": [],
      "error": "no_participants"
    }
  ],

  "balances": [
    {
      "name": "one dinner, one payer, split three ways",
      "participants": ["a", "b", "c"],
      "expenses": [
        {
          "paid_by": { "a": "64.00" },
          "paid_for": { "a": "21.34", "b": "21.33", "c": "21.33" }
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "a": { "paid": "64.00", "share": "21.34", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "42.66" },
        "b": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "21.33", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "-21.33" },
        "c": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "21.33", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "-21.33" }
      },
      "total": "64.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "two expenses and two payers settle out",
      "participants": ["a", "b"],
      "expenses": [
        { "paid_by": { "a": "30.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "15.00", "b": "15.00" } },
        { "paid_by": { "b": "30.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "15.00", "b": "15.00" } }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "a": { "paid": "30.00", "share": "30.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "0.00" },
        "b": { "paid": "30.00", "share": "30.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "0.00" }
      },
      "total": "60.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "several payers on one expense",
      "participants": ["a", "b", "c"],
      "expenses": [
        {
          "paid_by": { "a": "40.00", "b": "24.00" },
          "paid_for": { "a": "21.34", "b": "21.33", "c": "21.33" }
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "a": { "paid": "40.00", "share": "21.34", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "18.66" },
        "b": { "paid": "24.00", "share": "21.33", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "2.67" },
        "c": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "21.33", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "-21.33" }
      },
      "total": "64.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "someone who has left still owes what they owed",
      "participants": ["a"],
      "expenses": [
        { "paid_by": { "a": "50.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "25.00", "gone": "25.00" } }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "a": { "paid": "50.00", "share": "25.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "25.00" },
        "gone": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "25.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "-25.00" }
      },
      "total": "50.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "a member with nothing on the list still appears, at zero",
      "participants": ["a", "quiet"],
      "expenses": [{ "paid_by": { "a": "10.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "10.00" } }],
      "expect": {
        "a": { "paid": "10.00", "share": "10.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "0.00" },
        "quiet": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "0.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "0.00" }
      },
      "total": "10.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "a solo list is always square with itself",
      "participants": ["a"],
      "expenses": [
        { "paid_by": { "a": "84.20" }, "paid_for": { "a": "84.20" } },
        { "paid_by": { "a": "12.30" }, "paid_for": { "a": "12.30" } }
      ],
      "expect": { "a": { "paid": "96.50", "share": "96.50", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "0.00" } },
      "total": "96.50"
    },
    {
      "name": "tied balances go by plain id order, not the viewer's locale",
      "participants": ["a1", "A1", "a-1"],
      "expenses": [
        {
          "paid_by": { "A1": "10.00", "a1": "10.00", "a-1": "10.00" },
          "paid_for": { "A1": "10.00", "a1": "10.00", "a-1": "10.00" }
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "A1": { "paid": "10.00", "share": "10.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "0.00" },
        "a-1": { "paid": "10.00", "share": "10.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "0.00" },
        "a1": { "paid": "10.00", "share": "10.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "0.00" }
      },
      "total": "30.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "an empty list",
      "participants": ["a", "b"],
      "expenses": [],
      "expect": {
        "a": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "0.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "0.00" },
        "b": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "0.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "0.00" }
      },
      "total": "0.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "income alone: whoever took it in owes the group their share of it",
      "participants": ["a", "b", "c"],
      "expenses": [
        {
          "type": "income",
          "paid_by": { "a": "30.00" },
          "paid_for": { "a": "10.00", "b": "10.00", "c": "10.00" }
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "b": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "-10.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "10.00" },
        "c": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "-10.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "10.00" },
        "a": { "paid": "-30.00", "share": "-10.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "-20.00" }
      },
      "total": "30.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "the refund scenario: an expense, a settlement, then a refund of part of it",
      "participants": ["a", "b", "c"],
      "expenses": [
        {
          "type": "expense",
          "paid_by": { "a": "60.00" },
          "paid_for": { "a": "20.00", "b": "20.00", "c": "20.00" }
        },
        { "type": "transfer", "paid_by": { "b": "20.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "20.00" } },
        {
          "type": "income",
          "paid_by": { "a": "30.00" },
          "paid_for": { "a": "10.00", "b": "10.00", "c": "10.00" }
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "b": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "10.00", "settled": "20.00", "balance": "10.00" },
        "a": { "paid": "30.00", "share": "10.00", "settled": "-20.00", "balance": "0.00" },
        "c": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "10.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "-10.00" }
      },
      "total": "110.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "a transfer settles a debt exactly to zero",
      "participants": ["a", "b"],
      "expenses": [
        { "paid_by": { "a": "30.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "15.00", "b": "15.00" } },
        { "type": "transfer", "paid_by": { "b": "15.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "15.00" } }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "a": { "paid": "30.00", "share": "15.00", "settled": "-15.00", "balance": "0.00" },
        "b": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "15.00", "settled": "15.00", "balance": "0.00" }
      },
      "total": "45.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "a transfer from someone who owed nothing leaves them in credit",
      "participants": ["a", "b", "c"],
      "expenses": [
        { "paid_by": { "a": "20.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "10.00", "b": "10.00" } },
        { "type": "transfer", "paid_by": { "c": "5.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "5.00" } }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "a": { "paid": "20.00", "share": "10.00", "settled": "-5.00", "balance": "5.00" },
        "c": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "0.00", "settled": "5.00", "balance": "5.00" },
        "b": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "10.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "-10.00" }
      },
      "total": "25.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "income above the expenses turns the payer's credit into a debt",
      "participants": ["a", "b"],
      "expenses": [
        { "paid_by": { "a": "10.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "5.00", "b": "5.00" } },
        {
          "type": "income",
          "paid_by": { "a": "40.00" },
          "paid_for": { "a": "20.00", "b": "20.00" }
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "b": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "-15.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "15.00" },
        "a": { "paid": "-30.00", "share": "-15.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "-15.00" }
      },
      "total": "50.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "an uneven income splits like an expense: leftover cents to the first participants",
      "participants": ["a", "b", "c"],
      "expenses": [
        {
          "type": "income",
          "paid_by": { "a": "10.00" },
          "paid_for": { "a": "3.34", "b": "3.33", "c": "3.33" }
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "b": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "-3.33", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "3.33" },
        "c": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "-3.33", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "3.33" },
        "a": { "paid": "-10.00", "share": "-3.34", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "-6.66" }
      },
      "total": "10.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "a mixed ledger of all three types, one entry with no type at all",
      "participants": ["a", "b", "c", "d"],
      "expenses": [
        {
          "paid_by": { "a": "40.00" },
          "paid_for": { "a": "10.00", "b": "10.00", "c": "10.00", "d": "10.00" }
        },
        { "type": "expense", "paid_by": { "b": "12.00" }, "paid_for": { "b": "6.00", "c": "6.00" } },
        {
          "type": "income",
          "paid_by": { "c": "9.00" },
          "paid_for": { "a": "3.00", "b": "3.00", "c": "3.00" }
        },
        { "type": "transfer", "paid_by": { "d": "10.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "10.00" } }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "a": { "paid": "40.00", "share": "7.00", "settled": "-10.00", "balance": "23.00" },
        "d": { "paid": "0.00", "share": "10.00", "settled": "10.00", "balance": "0.00" },
        "b": { "paid": "12.00", "share": "13.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "-1.00" },
        "c": { "paid": "-9.00", "share": "13.00", "settled": "0.00", "balance": "-22.00" }
      },
      "total": "71.00"
    }
  ],

  "spent": [
    {
      "name": "expenses alone: the net is what was laid out",
      "expenses": [
        { "type": "expense", "paid_by": { "a": "60.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "60.00" } },
        { "paid_by": { "b": "10.00" }, "paid_for": { "b": "10.00" } }
      ],
      "expect": { "expenses": "70.00", "income": "0.00", "net": "70.00" }
    },
    {
      "name": "the refund scenario: the refund comes off what was spent",
      "expenses": [
        {
          "type": "expense",
          "paid_by": { "a": "60.00" },
          "paid_for": { "a": "20.00", "b": "20.00", "c": "20.00" }
        },
        { "type": "transfer", "paid_by": { "b": "20.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "20.00" } },
        {
          "type": "income",
          "paid_by": { "a": "30.00" },
          "paid_for": { "a": "10.00", "b": "10.00", "c": "10.00" }
        }
      ],
      "expect": { "expenses": "60.00", "income": "30.00", "net": "30.00" }
    },
    {
      "name": "transfers count for nothing: settling up is not spending",
      "expenses": [
        { "type": "transfer", "paid_by": { "a": "25.00" }, "paid_for": { "b": "25.00" } }
      ],
      "expect": { "expenses": "0.00", "income": "0.00", "net": "0.00" }
    },
    {
      "name": "income above the expenses is a negative net",
      "expenses": [
        { "type": "expense", "paid_by": { "a": "10.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "10.00" } },
        { "type": "income", "paid_by": { "a": "40.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "40.00" } }
      ],
      "expect": { "expenses": "10.00", "income": "40.00", "net": "-30.00" }
    },
    {
      "name": "an entry with no type counts as an expense",
      "expenses": [{ "paid_by": { "a": "25.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "25.00" } }],
      "expect": { "expenses": "25.00", "income": "0.00", "net": "25.00" }
    },
    {
      "name": "an empty ledger has spent nothing",
      "expenses": [],
      "expect": { "expenses": "0.00", "income": "0.00", "net": "0.00" }
    }
  ],

  "effect": [
    {
      "name": "an expense credits whoever paid it",
      "expense": {
        "type": "expense",
        "paid_by": { "a": "64.00" },
        "paid_for": { "a": "21.34", "b": "21.33", "c": "21.33" }
      },
      "account": "a",
      "expect": "42.66"
    },
    {
      "name": "an expense debits whoever it was for",
      "expense": {
        "type": "expense",
        "paid_by": { "a": "64.00" },
        "paid_for": { "a": "21.34", "b": "21.33", "c": "21.33" }
      },
      "account": "b",
      "expect": "-21.33"
    },
    {
      "name": "an entry does nothing to an account that is not on it",
      "expense": {
        "type": "expense",
        "paid_by": { "a": "64.00" },
        "paid_for": { "a": "21.34", "b": "21.33", "c": "21.33" }
      },
      "account": "d",
      "expect": "0.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "paying only for yourself cancels out",
      "expense": { "paid_by": { "a": "10.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "10.00" } },
      "account": "a",
      "expect": "0.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "an entry with no type counts as an expense",
      "expense": { "paid_by": { "a": "10.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "4.00", "b": "6.00" } },
      "account": "a",
      "expect": "6.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "income debits whoever received it",
      "expense": {
        "type": "income",
        "paid_by": { "a": "30.00" },
        "paid_for": { "a": "10.00", "b": "10.00", "c": "10.00" }
      },
      "account": "a",
      "expect": "-20.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "income credits whoever it was credited to",
      "expense": {
        "type": "income",
        "paid_by": { "a": "30.00" },
        "paid_for": { "a": "10.00", "b": "10.00", "c": "10.00" }
      },
      "account": "b",
      "expect": "10.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "a transfer credits the sender",
      "expense": { "type": "transfer", "paid_by": { "b": "20.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "20.00" } },
      "account": "b",
      "expect": "20.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "a transfer debits the recipient",
      "expense": { "type": "transfer", "paid_by": { "b": "20.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "20.00" } },
      "account": "a",
      "expect": "-20.00"
    },
    {
      "name": "a transfer does nothing to anyone else",
      "expense": { "type": "transfer", "paid_by": { "b": "20.00" }, "paid_for": { "a": "20.00" } },
      "account": "c",
      "expect": "0.00"
    }
  ],

  "settle": [
    {
      "name": "one debt, one credit",
      "balances": { "a": "20.00", "b": "-20.00" },
      "expect": [{ "from": "b", "to": "a", "amount": "20.00" }]
    },
    {
      "name": "two equal debtors pay one creditor, in id order",
      "balances": { "a": "42.66", "b": "-21.33", "c": "-21.33" },
      "expect": [
        { "from": "b", "to": "a", "amount": "21.33" },
        { "from": "c", "to": "a", "amount": "21.33" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "one debtor pays two equal creditors, in id order",
      "balances": { "a": "10.00", "b": "10.00", "c": "-20.00" },
      "expect": [
        { "from": "c", "to": "a", "amount": "10.00" },
        { "from": "c", "to": "b", "amount": "10.00" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "the largest debtor and the largest creditor go first",
      "balances": { "a": "50.00", "b": "-30.00", "c": "-20.00" },
      "expect": [
        { "from": "b", "to": "a", "amount": "30.00" },
        { "from": "c", "to": "a", "amount": "20.00" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a partial payment leaves a remainder that is matched again",
      "balances": { "c1": "12.00", "c2": "6.00", "d1": "-10.00", "d2": "-8.00" },
      "expect": [
        { "from": "d1", "to": "c1", "amount": "10.00" },
        { "from": "d2", "to": "c2", "amount": "6.00" },
        { "from": "d2", "to": "c1", "amount": "2.00" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a former member still owes",
      "balances": { "a": "15.00", "former-1": "-15.00" },
      "expect": [{ "from": "former-1", "to": "a", "amount": "15.00" }]
    },
    {
      "name": "a former member is still owed",
      "balances": { "former-1": "9.00", "a": "-4.00", "b": "-5.00" },
      "expect": [
        { "from": "b", "to": "former-1", "amount": "5.00" },
        { "from": "a", "to": "former-1", "amount": "4.00" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a single leftover cent is a transfer",
      "balances": { "a": "0.01", "b": "-0.01" },
      "expect": [{ "from": "b", "to": "a", "amount": "0.01" }]
    },
    {
      "name": "all settled already",
      "balances": { "a": "0.00", "b": "0.00" },
      "expect": []
    },
    {
      "name": "a solo list has nothing to settle",
      "balances": { "a": "0.00" },
      "expect": []
    }
  ]
}
